1
00:00:01,599 --> 00:00:09,280
Hey, Earth, wait up! How are you getting home?
Is Gun picking you up?

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:13,840
No, I'll go back by myself.
Then how are you getting home? Come out with us.

3
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:19,675
Since your brother isn't coming anyway.

4
00:00:19,675 --> 00:00:22,425
And I've gotta go stay with Mom's friend.

5
00:00:23,261 --> 00:00:28,802
So you're basically alone, right?
Come on, hang out with us.

6
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:34,423
You haven't recovered yet.
Doesn't look like you've got anything to worry about.

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,359
Fine. I'll go.

8
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:56,520
Come on, let's go!
Yeah, drink it!

9
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,399
Hey, it's finished!
Hey!

10
00:00:58,399 --> 00:01:02,440
Let's go!
Drink it all—come on!

11
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:07,439
Whoa, enough. If you don't finish
this glass, you're paying.

12
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:11,439
What's so hard about that?

13
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:13,479
Pay it then.
That's it.

14
00:01:13,479 --> 00:01:17,479
Yeah.
It's not a big deal.

15
00:01:17,479 --> 00:01:20,752
Damn it.
Hey!

16
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:26,782
I saw some girl kiss you teasingly.

17
00:01:26,782 --> 00:01:29,648
- Are you seeing things?
- No, really.
